:answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.297" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd7e3563-001d-5b37-b49f-11776d7b682b" :answer/id #uuid "dd7e3563-001d-5b37-b49f-11776d7b682b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.412" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d9282e28-6b69-59ec-8d69-1f20cf128cea" :answer/id #uuid "d9282e28-6b69-59ec-8d69-1f20cf128cea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.711" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ed8bb07d-ed88-5d7c-a376-b5b20e72fc61" :question/id #uuid "ed8bb07d-ed88-5d7c-a376-b5b20e72fc61" :question/math-academy-id "q-108263" :question/problem "The table below gives the values of $x$ that satisfy $P(X\\ge x)=p,$ where $X∼{χ}^{2}(k).$ Given that the random variable $X∼{χ}^{2}(7),$ find the value of $x$ such that $P(X>x)=0.975.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.995$ | $0.990$ | $0.975$ | $0.950$ | $0.900$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $6$ | $\\,0.676\\,$ | $\\,0.872\\,$ | $\\,1.237\\,$ | $\\,1.635\\,$ | $\\,2.204\\,$ |\n| $7$ | $\\,0.989\\,$ | $\\,1.239\\,$ | $\\,1.690\\,$ | $\\,2.167\\,$ | $\\,2.833\\,$ |\n| $8$ | $\\,1.344\\,$ | $\\,1.646\\,$ | $\\,2.180\\,$ | $\\,2.733\\,$ | $\\,3.490\\,$ |" :question/worked-solution "Since $X∼{χ}^{2}(7),$ we focus on the row of the table that corresponds to $k=7.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.995$ | $0.990$ | $0.975$ | $0.950$ | $0.900$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $7$ | $\\,0.989\\,$ | $\\,1.239\\,$ | $\\,1.690\\,$ | $\\,2.167\\,$ | $\\,2.833\\,$ |\n\nFrom this row, we see that\n\n$$\nP(X>1.690)=0.975.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our answer is $x=1.690.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6bb6b39f-0033-59e4-bf9a-66aa3b7e8c0b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6bb6b39f-0033-59e4-bf9a-66aa3b7e8c0b" :answer-field/id #uuid "6bb6b39f-0033-59e4-bf9a-66aa3b7e8c0b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9a6dfc5f-3b5e-5c28-