lem "Let $A(1,0,1,0)$ and $B(-1,4,0,-1).$ Find the cosine of the angle $∠AOB$, where $O(0,0,0,0)$ is the origin." :question/worked-solution "First, let\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a=\\overset{\\to }{OA}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,b=\\overset{\\to }{OB}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, let $\\theta =m∠AOB$ be the angle between the vectors $a$ and $b.$ Then, we can find $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{‖a‖\\,‖b‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{1}{b}_{1}+{a}_{2}{b}_{2}+{a}_{3}{b}_{3}+{a}_{4}{b}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{1}^{2}+{a}_{2}^{2}+{a}_{3}^{2}+{a}_{4}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{{b}_{1}^{2}+{b}_{2}^{2}+{b}_{3}^{2}+{b}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 4+1\\cdot 0+0\\cdot (-1)}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{0}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{4}^{2}+{0}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1}{\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{18}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1}{\\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-396e31d7-971b-5c45-b7d7-da00f7454c2c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-396e31d7-971b-5c45-b7d7-da00f7454c2c" :answer-field/id #uuid "396e31d7-971b-5c45-b7d7-da00f7454c2c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e2349564-7be1-546c-b905-c0f5302320e3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-179642be-505d-5e1b-bb2a-b937afe83962" "answer-e2349564-7be1-546c-b905-c0f5302320e3" "answer-e12cb031-4be0-5534-ad8a-2cad6c375052" "answer-afb5358c-3022-5993-afeb-0b8224de5160" "answer-01ff0db7-bee8-5c22-bcf6-717f10c873bc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-179642be-505d-5e1b-bb2a-b937afe83962" :answer/id #uuid "179642be-505d-5e1b-bb2a-b937afe83962" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e2349564-7